Package: deepblue-base
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DeepBlue Project <maintainer@deepblue.example>
Installed-Size: 120
Depends: base-files
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: DeepBlue Linux base identity
 Owns the DeepBlue Linux distribution identity: /etc/os-release,
 /etc/lsb-release, TTY banners and the release marker under
 /etc/deepblue. Installing this package on a Debian system turns it
 into DeepBlue Linux.
